{"dog":{"age_group":"puppy","application_url":"https://petstablished.com/adoption_form/72603/generic","availability_detail":"unavailable","breed_display":null,"breed_primary":null,"description_text":"About:\n\nMeet Awang | Apply Now\n\nAwang is a 9-month-old Jindo Mix weighing 29 lbs. Rescued from a dog meat farm, this brave boy carries none of that past with him. He's the first to greet you, tail wagging and full of charm, and he's eating well, playing hard, and getting stronger every day. He can't wait to find his forever home in NYC!\n\nYou don’t have to wait for an adoption event. In-person meet-and-greets are available in the NYC area, with virtual meet-and-greets available for adopters outside NYC.\n\nMeet Us at Our Next Adoption Event\n\n- Spicy Moon LIC\n\n- Saturday, Dec 12\n\n- 1:00 PM - 4:00 PM\n\n- 45-04 Pearson St, Long Island City, NY 11101\n\nLearn more about our adoption process:\n\nwww.koreank9rescue.org/adoption-procedures\n\nwww.koreank9rescue.org/adoption-faq\n\nKorean K9 Rescue is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit saving dogs from the Korean dog meat trade and overcrowded shelters.\n\nSupport our mission:\n\n• Donate: www.koreank9rescue.org/donate\n\n• Patreon: www.patreon.com/koreank9rescue","detail_url":"https://www.koreank9rescue.org/adopt/#animal-18171ffb-2193-4270-8ec9-278679c1779e","id":"bc00f4256b3e4a1316ecfe84304e5aa5","image_urls":["https://d3rups3u5612eu.cloudfront.net/feed/f77646f0-ab78-4a6b-be3b-ae87fe09fe16/18171ffb-2193-4270-8ec9-278679c1779e/13fb852b-ac91-4086-ba55-d47562c3cc41/v2/beb78bb9-28b5-4cf5-930f-22639189e388.jpg","https://d3rups3u5612eu.cloudfront.net/feed/f77646f0-ab78-4a6b-be3b-ae87fe09fe16/18171ffb-2193-4270-8ec9-278679c1779e/0a87b604-c6bd-4897-bbe8-cdc153837fae/v0/d6f995db-7af5-4e9e-b123-531d211e4144.jpg","https://d3rups3u5612eu.cloudfront.net/feed/f77646f0-ab78-4a6b-be3b-ae87fe09fe16/18171ffb-2193-4270-8ec9-278679c1779e/fb974171-c9e3-4038-8eba-fc678a9ee034/v0/36fa82c7-36f7-4bed-9dcd-b387cd633a06.jpg","https://d3rups3u5612eu.clou